{
  "day": 1,
  "_note": "每件活三条路：self 自己做 / look 让它做我看一眼 / let 让它做。克总的话是英文常量；旁白中文。done 旗标和 content/days 的 task 条目一致。",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "task1",
      "title": "v17 过一遍。",
      "app": "docs",
      "done": "task_v17_done",
      "start": {
        "say": [
          {
            "k": "narration",
            "t": "克总已经把 v16 和 v17 并排放好了。第 6 条和第 11 条用不同的颜色标着。"
          }
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "mode": "self",
            "goto": "self"
          },
          {
            "mode": "look",
            "goto": "look"
          },
          {
            "mode": "let",
            "goto": "let"
          }
        ]
      },
      "self": {
        "say": [
          {
            "k": "narration",
            "t": "你从头读。读到第 6 条，读到第 11 条，你停下来。两条打架。"
          },
          {
            "k": "inner",
            "t": "白纸黑字，并排躺着。"
          }
        ],
        "kuro": [
          "Clause 6 and clause 11 contradict each other. Want me to merge?"
        ],
        "effects": {
          "flags": [
            "task_v17_done",
            "caught_6_11"
          ],
          "san": 1
        }
      },
      "look": {
        "say": [
          {
            "k": "narration",
            "t": "它合了一版。你点开，滚到第 6 条，滚到第 11 条。"
          }
        ],
        "kuro": [
          "Merged. Clause 11 now yields to clause 6."
        ],
        "effects": {
          "flags": [
            "task_v17_done"
          ],
          "san": 0,
          "looked": true
        }
      },
      "let": {
        "say": [
          {
            "k": "narration",
            "t": "你点了「通过」。合并版存进了文件夹，名字很整齐。"
          },
          {
            "k": "inner",
            "t": "你没看。"
          }
        ],
        "kuro": [
          "Saved."
        ],
        "effects": {
          "flags": [
            "task_v17_done"
          ],
          "san": -1,
          "letItDoUnchecked": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "task2",
      "title": "应收表改一个数。",
      "app": "ledger",
      "done": "task_receivable_done",
      "start": {
        "say": [
          {
            "k": "narration",
            "t": "甲方那一行，拖欠天数从 30 改成 31。一个格子，十秒钟的事。"
          }
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "mode": "self",
            "goto": "self"
          },
          {
            "mode": "look",
            "goto": "look"
          },
          {
            "mode": "let",
            "goto": "let"
          }
        ]
      },
      "self": {
        "say": [
          {
            "k": "narration",
            "t": "你自己改了。那一列还是你的小数点和那种参差。"
          }
        ],
        "kuro": [],
        "effects": {
          "flags": [
            "task_receivable_done"
          ],
          "san": 0
        }
      },
      "look": {
        "say": [
          {
            "k": "narration",
            "t": "它改了。格式也「顺手」统一了。你敲：格式别动。"
          }
        ],
        "kuro": [
          "Reverted."
        ],
        "effects": {
          "flags": [
            "task_receivable_done",
            "kept_format"
          ],
          "san": 0,
          "looked": true
        }
      },
      "let": {
        "say": [
          {
            "k": "narration",
            "t": "它改了，顺手把整列格式统一了。31 在甲方那一行，整整齐齐。"
          }
        ],
        "kuro": [
          "Done."
        ],
        "effects": {
          "flags": [
            "task_receivable_done"
          ],
          "san": -1,
          "letItDoUnchecked": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "task3",
      "title": "存一份合并文档。",
      "app": "docs",
      "done": "task_merge_done",
      "start": {
        "say": [
          {
